Description "General Grievous

The fiendish leader of the Separatist Droid Army. Excels at close-range encounters as well as quick escapes.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Jedi Lightsabers (Dual)
-- Saber Defense (3)
--- BP Regen: 2/.4s
--- BP-Free Jumps
-- Blaster Defense (1)
-- EX Saber Training (2)
-- Chain Limit: 6
-- 100% more Spec Dmg
- DT-57 'Annihilator' Blaster (Pistol 2)
-- 10% more Dmg/FP Dmg

^5Powers:
- Cyber Jump (1)

^8Attributes:
- 30% less Kb Taken
- Stamina (3)
- Dexterity (3)
- Strength (1)
- Beskar (3)
- Blast Armor
- Cortosis (1)
- Physical Resist
- Armor Regen (1)
- Force Block (2)

^3Abilities:
- Sprint ^3[CS1]
- Dash (1) ^3[CS2]
- Grappling Hook (1) ^3[Melee CS4]"